    "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>ALTERA is a faction-based military survival sandbox. Recruit soldiers, gather resources &amp; gear. Become the ultimate troop commander &amp; lead your faction to victory!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>True military sandbox.<br></li><li>PvPvE.<br></li><li>Troop Control.<br></li><li>Unit switching.<br></li><li>Make outposts.<br></li><li>Recruit soldiers.<br></li><li>True first person.<br></li><li>Penguins &amp; mangos.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Expand your troop</h2>Enlist soldiers who will follow you and execute your commands.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1ab87322138c7cf45cab726504dabed7.poster.avif?t=1735942316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1ab87322138c7cf45cab726504dabed7.webm?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1ab87322138c7cf45cab726504dabed7.mp4?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Clear enemy camps</h2>Command your troop to defeat enemy soldiers on hostile territories.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/ca32cb61d56e6f56a4c33f3073be5a63.poster.avif?t=1735942316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/ca32cb61d56e6f56a4c33f3073be5a63.webm?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/ca32cb61d56e6f56a4c33f3073be5a63.mp4?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your defense</h2>Use collected resources to place defensive structures and a command tower.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1b55a095212a7d64c18571bd1f2d1ffc.poster.avif?t=1735942316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1b55a095212a7d64c18571bd1f2d1ffc.webm?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/1b55a095212a7d64c18571bd1f2d1ffc.mp4?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Defend your territory</h2>Survive the attack on your tower to gain control over territory.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/d4d719b5b713385f042256772a6c724e.poster.avif?t=1735942316\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/d4d719b5b713385f042256772a6c724e.webm?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/796530/extras/d4d719b5b713385f042256772a6c724e.mp4?t=1735942316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
